1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,217
The Verge reports that TikTok will pay 400 million dollars to settle a US Justice Department lawsuit over children's privacy.

2
00:00:10,167 --> 00:00:19,549
The case accused TikTok of collecting data from young users without proper parental consent and failing to delete some accounts when asked.

3
00:00:19,549 --> 00:00:27,314
The settlement is a major signal that child safety rules for social platforms are becoming more serious.

